+    <message name="IDS_SETTINGS_SAFETY_HUB_PASSWORD_CHECK_SUBHEADER_NO_PASSWORDS_POLICY" desc="Subtitle of the passwords card in SafetyHub when there are no saved passwords and saving of passwords is disabled through enterprise policy. This text is shown below the header 'No saved passwords'. It explains that the SafetyHub features for passwords are not available since the user's organization has a policy in place that prevents the user from saving passwords in Redrob.">
       Your organization turned off saving passwords
