-      <message name="IDS_SETTINGS_AI_PAGE_MAIN_SUBLABEL_3" desc="This is a bullet point on a card that sets the context for the ‘AI innovations’ section of Chrome’s settings. Here, the user can see settings related to AI (artificial intelligence) in this section; these settings include Help me write and more. This bullet point is after the ‘Reimagine Chrome, supercharged with AI’ title and ‘Things to consider’ subheading. We want users to read this card and understand the considerations that apply to all Chrome’s AI features. This bullet point specifically notes that AI features are actively developing and results may include errors. The tone should be informative.">
